    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opposing [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), once an enemy unit picks its targets. Choose a single **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit of yours that it aimed at least one attack at, plus an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit of yours no more than 6\" from it. While the phase lasts, the attacked unit gains [Feel No Pain 4+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain), which works only against **Psychic** attacks or [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).",
